       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CSFMTNAM.
      *****************************************************************
      * CSS COMMON - CALLED SUBPROGRAM.  TAKES A RAW CUSTOMER NAME   *
      * ("LAST, FIRST") AND RETURNS A DISPLAY KEY ("FIRST LAST").    *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-WORK-NAME             PIC X(30).
       01  WS-LAST-NAME             PIC X(20).
       01  WS-FIRST-NAME            PIC X(20).
       01  WS-NAME-LEN              PIC S9(4)       COMP.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-RAW-NAME              PIC X(30).
       01  LK-DISPLAY-KEY           PIC X(40).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RAW-NAME LK-DISPLAY-KEY.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE LK-RAW-NAME TO WS-WORK-NAME
           INSPECT WS-WORK-NAME TALLYING WS-NAME-LEN
                   FOR ALL ' '
           UNSTRING WS-WORK-NAME DELIMITED BY ','
               INTO WS-LAST-NAME WS-FIRST-NAME
           END-UNSTRING
           STRING WS-FIRST-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
                  ' '           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                  WS-LAST-NAME  DELIMITED BY SPACE
                  INTO LK-DISPLAY-KEY
           END-STRING
           GOBACK.
